{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114070004165-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114091323\"/><p>碎石廠火光熊熊。</p><p>青衣發生火警。昨日(13日)晚上11時28分，有市民報案，指青衣牛角灣發生火警。消防接報趕至開動兩條喉及派出兩隊煙帽隊進行灌救。至今日(14日)凌晨1時02分將火撲熄，事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><p>經初步調查相信，上址碎石廠有工人收工前未有關閉碎石機電源，導致機器過熱引起火警，起火原因沒有可疑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:37:52.365092+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:00:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T12:18:15.213571+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:31:05.913591+00:00","content_hash":"49d22f97896c3c99b73aa28b0e41fc0e5d6f3fc80cb4a27420fd61bfedf96e8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}